It should be Vegan.
Manufacturers do all sorts of things,
and they'll put in flavorings and stabilizers that might not be.
Yes, you should check the label.
You should see either cyanocobalamin or methylcobalamin on the label,
but basically nothing much else in there.
The cyanocobalamin will work just fine for everybody.
It's cheaper, that's what I would recommend for everybody.
